  "description": "Fast CPU block compressor for BC1/BC3/BC4/BC5/BC6H/BC7 GPU texture formats, backed by Binomial's basis_universal analytical real-time encoders (bc7f / encode_bc1 / fast_encode_bc6h). Safe span-based API, allocation-free, with single-block and streaming (banded) entry points. No ISPC toolchain and no GPU required.",
